   Anastasios Papadopoulos: AUTO-CI, single reference methods and gradients
   Taras Petrenko         : DFT Hessian,TD-DFT gradient, ASA, ECA, R-Raman, ABS, FL, XAS/XES, NRVS
   Peter Pinski           : DLPNO-MP2, DLPNO-MP2 Gradient
